1
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:45,150
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:46,850
[Episode 29]

3
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:47,340
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,220
Slow down. Don't fall.

6
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:02,040
Shu Tinglan.

7
00:01:02,970 --> 00:01:03,880
What's wrong?

8
00:01:04,610 --> 00:01:07,040
You said today that I could hold you.

9
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:09,680
Is that just for today,

10
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,130
or can I hold you from now on too?

11
00:01:13,250 --> 00:01:14,080
I...

12
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:16,000
i've been by your side
these past few years.

13
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,400
I feel so lucky.

14
00:01:18,370 --> 00:01:19,640
Can I...

15
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:22,140
keep staying with you all from now on?

16
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,730
What are you talking about?

17
00:01:24,810 --> 00:01:26,310
Why are you talking nonsense?

18
00:01:26,310 --> 00:01:27,720
Aren't you always

19
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:29,780
by Xiao He's and my side every day?

20
00:01:30,660 --> 00:01:31,720
I mean,

21
00:01:33,670 --> 00:01:35,000
as your boyfriend.

22
00:01:36,610 --> 00:01:38,460
Whatever your concerns are,
I can handle them.

23
00:01:38,460 --> 00:01:41,120
Mom, there's a puppy inside.

24
00:01:41,140 --> 00:01:43,160
Got it. I'm coming.

25
00:01:43,190 --> 00:01:44,200
Don't go in.

26
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:52,560
I don't want to be
a step behind him again.

27
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:00,320
Yi Muyang.

28
00:02:02,740 --> 00:02:03,920
I'm very grateful

29
00:02:03,940 --> 00:02:05,160
that you've been with

30
00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:06,820
Xiao He and me all these years.

31
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:08,970
You are also a very good person.

32
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:10,840
But

33
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:13,520
as far as I can see, now and in the future

34
00:02:14,140 --> 00:02:15,540
we'll always be friends.

35
00:02:16,610 --> 00:02:17,720
Not just my friend,

36
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:19,380
but also Xiao He's.

37
00:02:19,410 --> 00:02:20,760
Right?

38
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,480
Mom.

39
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:27,160
Coming.

40
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,240
Shushu.

41
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:47,200
When are you going to hold the wedding?

42
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:49,600
I want to be
the most beautiful bridesmaid.

43
00:03:49,820 --> 00:03:51,000
I know.

44
00:03:51,570 --> 00:03:53,970
I'll buy you
the most beautiful dress then.

45
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,840
Never mind.

46
00:03:56,150 --> 00:03:57,300
You'd better choose it yourself.

47
00:03:57,300 --> 00:03:58,430
I'll reimburse you.

48
00:03:59,010 --> 00:04:00,320
It's a deal then.

49
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,890
Don't make me wait too long.

50
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:05,640
Because I want to
see you at your happiest.

51
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,480
Tinglan.

52
00:04:07,020 --> 00:04:08,640
Let's go on our honeymoon.

53
00:04:09,020 --> 00:04:10,040
Okay.

54
00:04:17,110 --> 00:04:18,040
Zhuo Yu'an?

55
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,560
Nannan?

56
00:04:21,579 --> 00:04:22,480
Zhuo Yu'an?

57
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,080
Mom.

58
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,040
Mom!

59
00:04:46,159 --> 00:04:47,280
Mom.

60
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,400
Mom.

61
00:04:51,510 --> 00:04:52,560
Baby, don't move.

62
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:58,740
Don't move.

63
00:04:58,760 --> 00:04:59,360
Come here.

64
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:01,920
You stay here.

65
00:05:02,060 --> 00:05:03,060
Mom will clean up.

66
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,080
Mom.

67
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:10,880
What's wrong?

68
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:16,600
Mom,

69
00:05:16,850 --> 00:05:18,720
who is this auntie?

70
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:29,000
She is Mom's best friend.

71
00:05:29,650 --> 00:05:32,560
Why have I never seen her?

72
00:05:33,390 --> 00:05:34,200
Well,

73
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:35,420
do you want to see her?

74
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:40,760
If Mom wants to, then I do.

75
00:05:52,150 --> 00:05:53,760
Who is it?

76
00:06:00,180 --> 00:06:01,320
Who is it?

77
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,000
Are you going to let me...

78
00:06:05,590 --> 00:06:07,440
Hello, Aunt Nan.

79
00:06:07,460 --> 00:06:09,440
My name is Shu Nianhe.

80
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:12,120
This is my mom, Shu Tinglan.

81
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:18,560
Nannan,

82
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,920
happy birthday.

83
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,720
Shu Tinglan,

84
00:06:33,740 --> 00:06:36,200
where the hell
have you been all these years?

85
00:06:36,310 --> 00:06:37,800
Not a single text

86
00:06:37,820 --> 00:06:40,440
and a single call from you.

87
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:43,240
You just vanished into thin air.

88
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:45,520
I thought I'd never find you again.

89
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:48,240
Alright.

90
00:06:49,659 --> 00:06:51,000
I'm perfectly fine

91
00:06:51,020 --> 00:06:52,280
and back now, aren't I?

92
00:06:53,700 --> 00:06:54,720
Get lost!

93
00:06:55,300 --> 00:06:56,820
Who asked you to come back now?

94
00:06:56,820 --> 00:06:58,220
Who even wants to see you?

95
00:06:58,440 --> 00:06:59,480
Back then,
when I went to the police station

96
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,600
to report you as a missing person,

97
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,000
why didn't you come back?

98
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,810
You didn't want that bad guy to find you.

99
00:07:03,810 --> 00:07:05,610
But what's that got to do with me?

100
00:07:08,300 --> 00:07:09,410
Aunt Nan,

101
00:07:09,430 --> 00:07:11,160
I'm leaving too.

102
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,840
Shu Tinglan, you've got some nerve.

103
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:18,160
Isn't it enough
that you've been struggling

104
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,720
out there all by yourself?

105
00:07:19,980 --> 00:07:21,960
You even brought back a little...

106
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:24,880
Get in here!

107
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:27,000
Thank you, Aunt Nan.

108
00:07:27,050 --> 00:07:28,480
Don't call me Auntie!

109
00:07:34,010 --> 00:07:35,080
Call me godmother.

110
00:07:45,900 --> 00:07:46,700
See?

111
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:49,120
All of these are yours.

112
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:49,880
These,

113
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,070
and these.

114
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:52,840
Play with them
as much as you want, sweetie.

115
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:54,970
If it's not enough, I will buy you more.

116
00:07:56,159 --> 00:07:57,440
Where were we?

117
00:07:57,760 --> 00:08:00,240
After Zhuo Yu'an saw the child,

118
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:01,840
did he say anything?

119
00:08:03,790 --> 00:08:04,640
No.

120
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:06,040
I didn't even talk to him.

121
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,900
I just grabbed Yi Muyang and left.

122
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:13,680
You...

123
00:08:15,050 --> 00:08:16,280
turned a perfectly good life

124
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,280
into a mess,

125
00:08:18,020 --> 00:08:19,680
as thrilling as a novel.

126
00:08:22,780 --> 00:08:24,080
But fortunately,

127
00:08:24,730 --> 00:08:25,720
you and Nian

128
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:27,320
are both safe and sound.

129
00:08:32,510 --> 00:08:33,640
So what's next?

130
00:08:33,990 --> 00:08:36,559
Are you planning to reconnect with him?

131
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,039
Probably not.

132
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:41,720
I like my life the way it is now.

133
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,960
Everyone's doing well on their own.

134
00:08:45,020 --> 00:08:46,480
I just hope

135
00:08:46,790 --> 00:08:48,520
she can grow up happily.

136
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:50,860
I don't want any more complications.

137
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,120
Since you got back,

138
00:08:55,310 --> 00:08:57,110
have you been to see your mother?

139
00:09:00,350 --> 00:09:02,880
His father passed away too.

140
00:09:04,780 --> 00:09:06,320
I heard.

141
00:09:10,140 --> 00:09:10,960
Shushu,

142
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,860
these past five years,

143
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:15,180
Zhuo Yu'an hasn't had it easy either.

144
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:17,920
Once I passed by your house.

145
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:20,040
I didn't have much hope,

146
00:09:20,990 --> 00:09:24,080
but I saw a figure

147
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:27,840
who was staying there all the time.

148
00:09:41,070 --> 00:09:42,000
Young lady,

149
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:44,840
do you know the owner of this house?

150
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:47,440
Ma'am,

151
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:49,440
do you know where she went?

152
00:09:49,670 --> 00:09:51,320
I thought you knew her

153
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,920
so I was just about to ask you.

154
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,200
This house

155
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:55,920
was bought by a man before.

156
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:59,080
He comes back to stay every few days.

157
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,250
Let me tell you.

158
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:01,480
This person is very strange.

159
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,740
He eats alone,

160
00:10:02,770 --> 00:10:04,430
but buys a whole table of food.

161
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:05,520
When he leaves,

162
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:07,520
he even talks to himself at the door.

163
00:10:07,610 --> 00:10:08,610
Isn't that weird?

164
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,740
You take your time waiting.

165
00:10:10,740 --> 00:10:11,470
I'm leaving.

166
00:10:18,190 --> 00:10:19,280
Shushu,

167
00:10:20,650 --> 00:10:21,600
if

168
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:24,300
Zhuo Yu'an has been waiting for you
to come back all this time,

169
00:10:24,300 --> 00:10:27,600
do you really have the heart
to never see him again?

170
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:31,360
I'll see.

171
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:32,840
You know me.

172
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:35,560
Just let me keep avoiding it for a while.

173
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:39,890
Once I wrap up the cases I'm working on,

174
00:10:40,820 --> 00:10:43,290
if we're meant to meet, then we'll see.

175
00:10:46,780 --> 00:10:48,730
I'm here!

176
00:10:48,930 --> 00:10:51,320
All pile on! All pile on!

177
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:58,680
I found it.

178
00:10:58,710 --> 00:11:00,440
She is at Lanshan Law Firm now.

179
00:11:04,490 --> 00:11:05,190
[Lanshan Law Firm Business Lawyer] [Hello]

180
00:11:05,210 --> 00:11:05,780
[I'd like to discuss a case cooperation with you.
How should I contact you?]

181
00:11:09,700 --> 00:11:10,400
Hello.

182
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:12,700
I'd like to discuss case
cooperation with you.

183
00:11:12,700 --> 00:11:14,100
How should I contact you?

184
00:11:16,210 --> 00:11:18,000
[Law Consultation of Lanshan Law Firm]

185
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:20,000
What kind of issue
would you like to consult about?

186
00:11:31,380 --> 00:11:32,870
[Law Consultation of Lanshan Law Firm]

187
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:33,530
Economic disputes.

188
00:11:38,860 --> 00:11:40,670
[Law Consultation of Lanshan Law Firm]

189
00:11:38,910 --> 00:11:40,720
Please describe your specific problem.

190
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,720
I can provide a preliminary answer.

191
00:11:57,290 --> 00:11:59,090
[Law Consultation of Lanshan Law Firm]

192
00:12:03,180 --> 00:12:05,200
It's too late today. Never mind.

193
00:12:03,610 --> 00:12:05,700
[Law Consultation of Lanshan Law Firm]

194
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:07,240
I'll consult you further later.

195
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:19,200
Mr. Zhuo.

196
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,880
There are indeed problems with

197
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:22,400
Ruixin's technology agreement.

198
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:24,260
But no dispute has broken out yet.

199
00:12:24,580 --> 00:12:26,840
We can't get more concrete evidence.

200
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:28,560
Okay.

201
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:30,000
Keep an eye on it.

202
00:12:30,420 --> 00:12:31,280
Also,

203
00:12:32,090 --> 00:12:33,520
coordinate with PR

204
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,540
and put out word about our new technology

205
00:12:35,540 --> 00:12:37,540
benchmarked against Ruixin's products.

206
00:12:37,540 --> 00:12:38,520
Okay.
